    <string name="fonts_manage_note">Turning it off hands every use back first: the tablet goes back to the font it had before, or the Boox default; the home screen follows the system font; this app goes back to Archivo; the sleep screen uses the tablet font. Then the files move into app storage, out of the Boox fonts folder and Documents, so nothing offers it. Turning it on puts them back and gives back those uses, unless you’ve chosen something else since. Delete hands back the same uses, then removes every copy this app made.</string>
